package.json
    Entry point to app
    contains packages used in app
    script (start, test)
    Meta Data ( name, version, description)

// Step to generate(create) package.json
    Nodejs must be installed in machine
        > go inside the project folder in terminal
        > run command -> npm init
        > Answer all questions
        > type yes

// step to install package
    > npm i package_name or npm install package_name
    